ℹ GetOpenFilename / GetSaveAsFilename pop a path prompt on a Screen (Tab completes, Enter opens or saves, Esc cancels and returns ""). Call them from a Screen event, then FileSystem.Read / Write the path.
ℹ The standard library is a Rust crate — `FileSystem.Read(...)` becomes `FileSystem::read(...)` and `use vbr_stdlib::…;` is added for you.